  "purpose": "A two-sided shore-watch shelter on the existing Cedar Approach. The native counter attendant keeps the last-walker lamp tradition; a returning paddler carries dry socks and agates. The room restores the missing named gate without shortening the winding coastal walk or changing any existing regional checkpoint.",
